Third-party Rust crates in zyphra-textnorm
==========================================

zyphra-textnorm's Python extension (zyphra_textnorm/zyphra_textnorm.abi3.so,
.pyd on Windows) in this add-on is Zyphra's published wheel of version
@VERSION@, built from https://github.com/Zyphra/zyphra-textnorm at tag
v@VERSION@ (crate python/, with zyphra-textnorm's own licence and notices in
the folder beside this file). It links the crates below statically. Each
crate's source, at the version named, is on
https://crates.io/crates/<name>/<version>.

